.DS_Store

# Raw meet files — these carry minors' birthdates and must never reach a public
# repo. This repo has no reason to hold one today, but it becomes a write target
# for the ingestion app layer: on a schedule mismatch the submitter can confirm a
# meet was rescheduled, and the corrected date is pushed back here. Deny by
# default so a path bug in that write cannot land a results file.
*.sd3
*.SD3
*.hy3
*.HY3
*.cl2
*.CL2
*.zip
*.ZIP
